        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kalvary ching khou Poubaomei ta;",
            "Kros rukhou sauh pirun le;",
            "Meinun rui zauna nuih khang,",
            "Kros rukhou tei thaenglou the.",
            "",
            "He! Adih sucho?",
            "Pouh rui khaengloumei tei;",
            "Kapi, kaphai kabaanh zaulo!",
            "Kandihmei paap zaeng khou rui,",
            "Nthanmei zei luang kei e",
            "Nzian liang meipu ta.",
            "",
            "2. Theih khang tari bampui gan khou tei,",
            "Mei khatna sini makge;",
            "Zauzihmei nu rui raina,",
            "Tari liat laknga thei the.",
            "",
            "3. Tari e na bampui gan khou tei,",
            "Khianghmei dui ti-zanglou e;",
            "Khianghmei dui rui kim lakge,",
            "Bumaengh khang tarimei tei.",
            "",
            "4. Bumaengta kanlou mei Pu zei tei,",
            "Ai rui din ngam thui lakge;",
            "Tatna Kalvary ching khou,",
            "Poubaomei ta guang zau lo."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
